###############################################################################
# Rimward Turrets - .gitignore for a RimWorld XML mod
###############################################################################

## Release archives
# Built by zipping the Mod folder for a release. Regenerated on demand, so there
# is no reason to carry them in history where they would bloat every clone.
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
Release/
Releases/
build/

## Game logs and runtime output, wherever they land
Player.log
Player-prev.log
*.log

## IDE / editor cruft
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.sublime-workspace
*.bak
*.old
*~

## OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

###############################################################################
# Local-only working material. NOT for publication.
#
# The Workshop description, Photoshop sources and other mods' files, kept next
# to the repository to write patches against. Other people's work under other
# people's terms; this mod ships none of it.
#
# Remove an entry only if you deliberately intend to publish it.
###############################################################################
external-files/
